Ryoku: I was planning to catch the
Pokémon called Volcarona that lives{VAR BE00}
in this Relic Castle and present it{VAR BE00}
to Ghetsis.{VAR BE01}
But the Shadow Triad said that Ghetsis
has gone somewhere, right?{VAR BE01}

The Seven Sages...{VAR BE01}
We always said we were complete when the
seven of us were together.{VAR BE01}
Now I don't know the meaning of those
words anymore.{VAR BE01}
I guess I don't mind, even if we were
being used, but the dream is over.{VAR BE01}

I no longer need this.{VAR BE01}
Ghetsis gave it to me, but I have no use
for it.{VAR BE01}

Ryoku: This Relic Castle and our own
castle are both crumbling...{VAR BE01}
But what's different is that this Relic
Castle is the remains of a civilization.{VAR BE01}
And our castle left nothing behind...{VAR BE01}

Looker: Regarding Team Plasma...{VAR BE01}
I am an officer of the International
Police, and you must satisfy my request{VAR BE00}
for certain information!{VAR BE01}

Ryoku: Understood.{VAR BE01}
But we don't know much about Ghetsis or
our lord N!{VAR BE01}
We haven't even figured out if they are
father and son...{VAR BE01}

Looker: Accept my thanks!{VAR BE01}
Now, Ghetsis notwithstanding,
there yet remains but {VAR 0200 0000} of the{VAR BE00}
Seven Sages still at large.{VAR BE01}
They are thinking--upon what topics?
They are hoping--upon what chances?{VAR BE01}
This is of the utmost urgency.
At once! On the way!{VAR BE01}

Looker: I thank you profoundly!{VAR BE01}
Curiously, {VAR 0100 0000}...
There is a topic on which we must speak.{VAR BE01}
A report has reached my ears of someone
far from here. Indeed, this someone has{VAR BE00}
spotted a person like N and a...{VAR BE00}
dragon Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
I depart to validate the validity
of this information.{VAR BE00}
We shall meet again, so until then, adieu.{VAR BE01}
